10 0 obj
<< /Length 585 >>
stream
BT /F2 26 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 526.00 Tm (What Is Digestion?) Tj ET
56 508.00 680 1.5 re f
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 467.00 Tm (- Digestion breaks food down into nutrients the body can absorb.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 435.00 Tm (- Mechanical digestion physically breaks food into smaller pieces \(chewing,) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 411.00 Tm (churning\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 379.00 Tm (- Chemical digestion uses enzymes to split large molecules into usable ones.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 347.00 Tm (- The whole journey takes 24 to 72 hours from mouth to exit.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
11 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 792 612] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R /F2 4 0 R >> >> /Contents 12 0 R >>
