12 0 obj
<< /Length 405 >>
stream
BT /F2 26 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 526.00 Tm (Stop 1: The Mouth) Tj ET
56 508.00 680 1.5 re f
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 467.00 Tm (- Teeth grind food - mechanical digestion begins here.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 435.00 Tm (- Saliva contains amylase, an enzyme that starts breaking down starch.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 403.00 Tm (- The tongue shapes food into a bolus and pushes it toward the throat.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
