14 0 obj
<< /Length 428 >>
stream
BT /F2 26 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 526.00 Tm (Stop 2: Esophagus and Stomach) Tj ET
56 508.00 680 1.5 re f
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 467.00 Tm (- Peristalsis: rhythmic muscle contractions squeeze food downward.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 435.00 Tm (- The stomach stores, mixes, and churns food for about 2-4 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 403.00 Tm (- Gastric juice \(hydrochloric acid + pepsin\) digests protein into chyme.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
