16 0 obj
<< /Length 422 >>
stream
BT /F2 26 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 526.00 Tm (Stop 3: The Small Intestine) Tj ET
56 508.00 680 1.5 re f
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 467.00 Tm (- Most chemical digestion AND nutrient absorption happen here.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 435.00 Tm (- The liver sends bile to emulsify fats; the pancreas sends enzymes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 403.00 Tm (- Villi - millions of tiny folds - maximize the absorbing surface area.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
