BT /F2 26 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 526.00 Tm (Stop 4: The Large Intestine) Tj ET
56 508.00 680 1.5 re f
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 467.00 Tm (- Absorbs water and minerals back into the bloodstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 435.00 Tm (- Houses gut bacteria that produce some vitamins.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 403.00 Tm (- Compacts the remaining waste into stool for elimination.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
