56 508.00 680 1.5 re f
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 467.00 Tm (- Eat fiber-rich food: fruits, vegetables, whole grains.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 435.00 Tm (- Drink enough water throughout the day.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 403.00 Tm (- Chew slowly and avoid skipping meals.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 371.00 Tm (- Wash hands before eating to prevent infections.) Tj ET
